<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>BL70X on Open Bouffalo</title><link>https://openbouffalo.github.io/chips/bl70x/</link><description>Recent content in BL70X on Open Bouffalo</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://openbouffalo.github.io/chips/bl70x/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>BootROM</title><link>https://openbouffalo.github.io/chips/bl70x/bootrom/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://openbouffalo.github.io/chips/bl70x/bootrom/</guid><description>&lt;div class="flex align-center gdoc-page__anchorwrap"&gt;
 &lt;h2 id="general-information"
 &gt;
 General information
 &lt;/h2&gt;
 &lt;a data-clipboard-text="https://openbouffalo.github.io/chips/bl70x/bootrom/#general-information" class="gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center" title="Anchor to: General information" aria-label="Anchor to: General information" href="#general-information"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="gdoc-icon gdoc_link"&gt;&lt;use xlink:href="#gdoc_link"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: &lt;code&gt;0x21000000 - 0x21020000&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Size: &lt;code&gt;128 KiB&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can boot from: USB, UART, SPI Flash&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BootROM mode trigger: IO28 pulled HIGH&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class="flex align-center gdoc-page__anchorwrap"&gt;
 &lt;h2 id="boot-info-header-structure"
 &gt;
 Boot Info header structure
 &lt;/h2&gt;
 &lt;a data-clipboard-text="https://openbouffalo.github.io/chips/bl70x/bootrom/#boot-info-header-structure" class="gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center" title="Anchor to: Boot Info header structure" aria-label="Anchor to: Boot Info header structure" href="#boot-info-header-structure"&gt;
 &lt;svg class="gdoc-icon gdoc_link"&gt;&lt;use xlink:href="#gdoc_link"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
 &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Size: &lt;code&gt;24 Bytes&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;Byte 0 - 3&lt;/code&gt; - BootROM version&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;Byte 4&lt;/code&gt; - Sign configuration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;Byte 5&lt;/code&gt; - Encrypt configuration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;Byte 6 - 15&lt;/code&gt; - Unknown&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;Byte 16 - 23&lt;/code&gt; - ChipID (Something related to MAC)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class="flex align-center gdoc-page__anchorwrap"&gt;
